1. EC2 vs ECS Scenario
Question

Your Spring Boot application is currently deployed on EC2 instances. Management wants easier deployment and scaling. What would you recommend?

Answer
Move to ECS (Elastic Container Service)
Containerize application using Docker
Use ECS Service Auto Scaling
Interview One-Liner
ECS reduces infrastructure management compared to EC2.


2. ECS vs EKS Scenario
Question

When would you choose ECS over EKS?

Answer

